# A chat's model picker with two orgs' Anthropic keys under the person's own.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
signed-in
project storefront shop
orgkey here "Lumen Studio" openrouter
orgrole admin "Fjord Labs"
orgkey here "Fjord Labs" openrouter
orgrole user "Fjord Labs"
chat Mira
title "Order emails"
settle 6
type "/model" 30
key enter
settle 2
snap org-keys-picker
